    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Evidence appears to be sparse case records rather than an open cohort.", "Local scarring or altered stem-cell niches are rival mechanisms.", "Pattern memory is an interpretation of persistent local effects.";
